"""Synthetic transport only. Real publication is checked separately."""
import os
import sys
from pathlib import Path
from builtins import SystemExit

failed ∈ str ← os.environ.get("APK_TRANSPORT_FAIL", "0")
if failed == "1":
    raise SystemExit(7)
all_arguments ∈ list[str] ← sys.argv
arguments ∈ list[str] ← all_arguments[1:]
index ∈ int ← arguments.index("-o")
output ∈ str ← arguments[index + 1]
fixture ∈ str ← os.environ.get("APK_FIXTURE", "")
Path(output).write_bytes(Path(fixture).read_bytes())
